* Task 5 (Feature 28, Phase B) fixture: DEFINE DATA with VIEW OF declarations
* Exercises:
* - VIEW OF syntax (with and without OF keyword)
* - Bare selected fields (inherit type from DDM)
* - Restated-format field (explicit type in the view declaration)
* - Array field
* - In-view REDEFINE block
* - Ordinary non-view field (regression check)

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 #EMPLOYEE
1 EMP-VIEW VIEW OF EMPLOYEES
  2 PERSONNEL-ID
  2 FULL-NAME (A40)
  2 SALARY (P9,2)
  2 TAGS (A10/1:10)
  2 REDEFINE PERSONNEL-ID
    3 #ID-PREFIX (A2)
    3 #ID-NUM (N6)
1 ANOTHER-VIEW VIEW CUSTOMER
  2 CUST-ID
  2 CUST-NAME (A30)
END-DEFINE

END
